    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>STORY</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Nolan Mercer</strong>, a technician working for <strong>Icarus Foundation</strong>, a corporation attempting to explore and monetize a strange, infinite structure they call <i>The Habitat</i>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The halls are empty. The lights hum faintly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And something feels <i>wrong</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>GAMEPLAY</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Than Just Walking</strong> \u2013 Navigate environmental challenges, interact with the world, and uncover hidden mechanics that go beyond simple exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror with Depth</strong> \u2013 Tension builds through atmosphere, sound, and unsettling encounters, avoiding reliance on simple jump scares.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Unpredictable Journey</strong> \u2013 No clear path, no certainty\u2014just the overwhelming feeling that something is terribly wrong.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><br><i>Welcome to the Facility of Dusk.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>STORY</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Nolan Mercer</strong>, a technician working for <strong>Icarus Foundation</strong>, a corporation attempting to explore and monetize a strange, infinite structure they call <i>The Habitat</i>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The halls are empty. The lights hum faintly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And something feels <i>wrong</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>GAMEPLAY</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Than Just Walking</strong> \u2013 Navigate environmental challenges, interact with the world, and uncover hidden mechanics that go beyond simple exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror with Depth</strong> \u2013 Tension builds through atmosphere, sound, and unsettling encounters, avoiding reliance on simple jump scares.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Unpredictable Journey</strong> \u2013 No clear path, no certainty\u2014just the overwhelming feeling that something is terribly wrong.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><br><i>Welcome to the Facility of Dusk.</i></p>",
